sequenceDiagram
  actor P as Player
  participant T as TouchControls
  participant S as WorldScene
  participant I as SearchInteraction
  participant V as InventoryPort
  participant E as EventBus
  P->>T: Hold keyboard or touch E
  S->>T: held("E")
  T-->>S: true or false
  S->>S: Check phase, range, line of sight, light and evidence
  alt Invalid condition, release, movement or damage
    S->>I: cancel()
    S-->>P: Show cancellation reason
  else Valid search condition
    S->>I: begin(pointId)
    loop While E is held
      S->>I: progress()
    end
    S->>I: finish(item, V.addLoot)
    alt Inventory full or invalid source
      I-->>S: { ok: false }
      S-->>P: Keep search point and show retry hint
    else Loot accepted
      I-->>S: { ok: true }
      S->>E: emit(LocationInteracted)
      S-->>P: Add loot to raid inventory
    end
  end
